  "prefLabel": "Ph 2005.04 Renewal Application Deficiencies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2005.04 Renewal Application Deficiencies. The board shall notify the applicant in writing as to whom the application for renewal is deficient. The applicant may, within 10 days after the date of the notice of deficiency, correct the deficiency or file with the board a written request for an appeal.\n\nSource. #12336, eff 7-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
